          "The SynSemClass Search Tool provides a web search tool for the SynSemClass ontology (4.0 and higher). It includes several search options and criteria for building complex queries. The search results are rendered in a clear and user-friendly interactive representation.\r\n\r\nThe source code for the service is available on github (https://github.com/ufal/SynSemClassSearch)."
